pan class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675850/extras/38f54e6a6008dd4c704e080890ebcd10.poster.avif?t=1749496503\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675850/extras/38f54e6a6008dd4c704e080890ebcd10.webm?t=1749496503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675850/extras/38f54e6a6008dd4c704e080890ebcd10.mp4?t=1749496503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>This visual novel features:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>~2 hours of reading time</strong><br></li><li><strong>High-quality sprites and CGs:</strong> with blinking, speaking and dynamic camera movements<br></li><li><strong>Interactive records to explore</strong><br></li><li><strong>An original, immersive soundtrack</strong><br></li><li><strong>Partial voice acting</strong><br></li><li><strong>Accessibility options</strong> such as image captions, sound captions, and text legibility functions<br></li><li><strong>One ending</strong></li></ul>",
